---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeroBackdrop from '../../components/PageHeroBackdrop.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="General Terms and Conditions | Edusafe Netherlands"
  description="General Terms and Conditions for course registration, corporate training, payment, cancellation, and safety consulting by Edusafe."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-brand-primary text-white pt-12 pb-14 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-16 md:pt-24 md:pb-20 overflow-hidden">
    <PageHeroBackdrop
      image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1600"
      alt="General Terms & Conditions Edusafe"
    />
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative z-10">
      
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <a href="/en" class="hover:underline text-white/75 hover:text-white">Home</a>
        <span class="text-white/40">/</span>
        <span class="text-brand-accent">Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="heading-page mb-4 text-white">
        General Terms &amp; <span class="text-brand-accent">Conditions</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-white/90 text-sm max-w-2xl">
        Relating to: Edusafe Trainingen en Opleidingen, Oude Middenweg 241A, The Hague, The Netherlands (KvK 73291447).
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Legal Articles Section -->
  <section class="py-10 sm:py-16 bg-brand-cream relative">
    <div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="bg-white p-5 sm:p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-brand-dark/5 shadow-sm space-y-8 sm:space-y-10 text-sm text-brand-dark/85 leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-brand-secondary mb-4">
          Clause A - Course Conditions &amp; General Provisions
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          These General Terms and Conditions govern all commercial proposals, service agreements, training courses, and consulting deliverables provided by Edusafe Trainingen en Opleidingen (hereinafter: "Edusafe"), established in The Hague.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 1 - Definitions</h3>
          <p>Under these terms: <strong>Edusafe / Contractor</strong>: the service provider. <strong>Client / Trainee</strong>: the counterpart, corporate client, or individual candidate enrolling in an education program or receiving safety consulting.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 2 - Applicability</h3>
          <p>These terms apply to all proposals and contracts between Edusafe and a client. Any purchasing or other conflicting terms from the client are explicitly rejected.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 3 - Quotations &amp; Validity</h3>
          <p>All written offers are non-binding and valid for 30 calendar days unless stipulated otherwise. Quoted rates are expressed in Euros exclusive of VAT (unless legally exempt).</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 4 - Performance of the Agreement</h3>
          <p>Edusafe executes all agreements with professional diligence and conformity to statutory Dutch occupational health &amp; safety standards (such as NIBHV, Het Oranje Kruis, and SSVV/VCA).</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 5 - Course Enrolment &amp; Admission</h3>
          <p>Registrations for public sessions are processed on a first-come, first-served basis via our digital registration interface. Following registration, the candidate receives an official booking confirmation including facility details and preparation notes.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 6 - Invoicing &amp; Payment</h3>
          <p>Payment must be remitted within 14 calendar days of the invoice date to Edusafe's designated bank account (NL68 ABNA 0834117177). Failure to pay within terms constitutes immediate default.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 7 - Cancellation Policy</h3>
          <p>Cancellations by the client must be submitted in writing or via email. Cancellations up to 14 days before course commencement are entirely free of charge. Cancellations between 14 and 7 days incur a 50% cancellation fee. Cancellations within 7 days or no-shows remain liable for 100% of the course fee. Candidate substitutions by colleagues are permitted free of charge at all times.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 8 - Rescheduling by Edusafe</h3>
          <p>Edusafe reserves the right to reschedule a session in cases of insufficient attendance or force majeure (e.g., trainer illness). Enrolled candidates will be notified promptly and offered free rebooking or a full refund.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 9 - Limitation of Liability</h3>
          <p>Edusafe is solely liable for direct damages arising from an attributable failure in service performance. Total liability is strictly limited to the net invoice value of the affected assignment.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-brand-secondary mb-2">Article 10 - Governing Law &amp; Jurisdiction</h3>
          <p>All legal relationships involving Edusafe are governed exclusively by the laws of the Netherlands. Any disputes shall be submitted exclusively to the competent court in the district of The Hague.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-brand-dark/10 pt-6 text-xs text-brand-dark/60">
        Last revised: Edusafe Trainingen en Opleidingen The Hague &bull; KvK 73291447 &bull; VAT NL859442640B01
      </div>

    </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
